# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# Phase-1 slackdump stealth tokens. Both are required together: xoxc is the API
# token and xoxd is the `d` cookie, and Slack rejects either alone.
#
# Where to get them, from a logged-in Slack tab in Chrome:
#
#   xoxc  DevTools console on https://app.slack.com/client:
#           Object.values(JSON.parse(localStorage.localConfig_v2).teams)[0].token
#
#   xoxd  DevTools > Network > any /api/ request > Request Headers > Cookie:
#           find `d=xoxd-...` and copy up to the next `;`
#         It is HttpOnly, so the console cannot read it and the Application
#         panel does not always list it.
#
# The xoxd value stays URL-encoded (%2F, %2B) exactly as copied.
#
# These are browser-session credentials and rotate when the session does. The
# phase-2 internal Slack app replaces them with a stable token.
SLACK_XOXC_TOKEN=
SLACK_XOXD_TOKEN=
